<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A5.SS4.SSS4" title="In E-D Balanced Stacking ‣ Appendix E Real-World Experiment Details ‣ Learning Physical Principles from Interaction:Self-Evolving Planning via Test-Time Memory" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">E-D</span>4 </span>Safety Mechanism</span></a></li>
