<section id="A7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A7.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">G-B</span> </span><span id="A7.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ball Navigation: Detailed Specifications</span></h3>

<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following specifications enable spatial reasoning about ball navigation
through the obstacle course using obstacle IDs and spatial zones.</p>
</div>
