<section id="A7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A7.SS3.6" class="ltx_text">G-C</span> </span><span id="A7.SS3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Balanced Stacking: Detailed Specifications</span></h3>

<div id="A7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following specifications enable reasoning about stone selection using
a systematic naming convention for surfaces, shapes, and orientations.</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A7.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx399" class="ltx_listingline">================================================================
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx400" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx400.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">STONE</span><span id="lstnumberx400.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx400.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">NAMING</span><span id="lstnumberx400.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx400.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">SYSTEM</span><span id="lstnumberx400.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx400.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">AND</span><span id="lstnumberx400.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx400.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">PROPERTY</span><span id="lstnumberx400.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx400.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">REFERENCE</span>
