<section id="A8.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A8.SS5.6" class="ltx_text">H-E</span> </span><span id="A8.SS5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Hypothesis Generation Prompt Template</span></h3>

<div id="A8.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The consolidation engine uses the following <span id="A8.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">general template</span> to generate
hypotheses from clustered experiences. This template is task-agnostic and can be
instantiated for any manipulation task by providing task-specific descriptions
and examples.</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A8.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1412" class="ltx_listingline">============================================================
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx1413" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1413.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">HYPOTHESIS</span><span id="lstnumberx1413.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1413.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">GENERATION</span><span id="lstnumberx1413.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1413.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">FROM</span><span id="lstnumberx1413.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1413.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">EXPERIENCE</span><span id="lstnumberx1413.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1413.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">CLUSTERS</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx1414" class="ltx_listingline">============================================================
</div>
